WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.590
Understand Oracle's percentage before using
it.

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.450
Open Oracle for the chart you are reviewing.

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.870
In this example, eight of the ten checks
pass.

00:00:18.530 --> 00:00:20.710
Eight divided by ten is eighty percent
agreement.

00:00:24.530 --> 00:00:27.670
This is confluence: a count of conditions
that agree.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:32.690
It is not the probability that a trade will
win.

00:00:36.530 --> 00:00:41.390
Oracle and Aria use the same checks, so they
are not independent confirmations.

00:00:43.058 --> 00:00:47.668
In another example, six of ten checks agree:
sixty percent.

00:00:49.155 --> 00:00:53.915
Read the reasons. Aria says waiting, so
leave Apply unused.

00:00:56.155 --> 00:01:01.035
Tools help you prepare. Review the evidence,
and decide with care.
